  "details": "There appears to be an undocumented maximum distance from the player's camera at which the VRCHeadChop component will no longer hide the target bone.\n\n**This distance limit unfortunately prevents certain avatars from switching from worse-performing scale constraints to the new component.**\n\nA slider to customize the maximum distance component-wide or per-bone would be appreciated. Alternatively, an option to disable these checks altogether would suffice.",
